docs/ADOPTION-BAR-SUBJECTS.md-86-passes all of them. C12 follows FOUNDATION promise 7, a middle line, and Curio Class does not claim to satisfy any
docs/ADOPTION-BAR-SUBJECTS.md-87-state's values criteria. Said once here, so it is not re-opened per course. Cory's values rule (2026-11-12) now
