|---|---|---|---|---|
| g2-question-to-research (library grade 2 unit 1, days 1 to 6) | A question-word question about a class topic, with help | 1 | g3-research-questions | Retrieval: write one who, what, where, when, why or how question about a picture |
| g2-catalog-lookup (library grade 2 unit 2, days 7 to 12) | Finding a book by title or author in a printed catalog and by shelf order | 2 | g3-key-words; g3-safe-searching | Retrieval: find one book from a printed title entry and say its shelf label |
| g2-kinds-of-sources (library grade 2 unit 1, days 1 to 6) | Matching a question to the kind of source likely to answer it | 3 | g3-source-kinds-and-makers | Retrieval: pick the kind of source for two questions |
| g2-who-made-it (library grade 2 unit 3, days 15 to 20) | Naming who made a book or page and why | 3 | g3-source-kinds-and-makers | Retrieval: name the maker and purpose of one invented page |
