75: ## 3. How the standard maps to our courses
76: 
77: Settled 2026-11-16 (Cory, Desk card q-later-cs-career-library): one course per grade K to 5, then one course for
78: grades 6 to 8 and one for grades 9 to 12, eight courses. The K to 5 courses each plan one year, so the skills grow
79: every year. The 6 to 8 and 9 to 12 courses spread across their grades, about one session every two weeks, taught
80: alongside other classes so research skills come back each year. Settled 2026-11-16 (Cory, Desk card q-later-followups-1).
81: Course ids: `library-k`, `library-1` to `library-5`, `library-6-8`, `library-9-12`, one row each in data/courses.csv
82: in the band-split form of health, PE and arts (Cory, 2026-11-21, Desk q-fix-library-1).
